    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MasterRunners is a free-to-play multiplayer hand based movement game surrounding a variety of entertaining gamemodes, cosmetics, obstacles, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>10+ gamemodes</strong>, we guarantee this game is worth your time. We have lots to offer, so what are you waiting for!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can do:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Gamemodes with players across the <strong>WORLD</strong>. MasterRunners can be played worldwide and with our <strong>advanced multiplayer system</strong>, you can enjoy multiplayer &amp; have a very fun time. For the gamemodes, we build special gamemodes that have never been used in others games making us stand out and more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/e34766ac1beff9d2b9d8637372f07982.avif?t=1749231596\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with friends and have a <strong>great time.</strong> With areas such as the &quot;Main Hub&quot;, you can relax and have a calming time with buddies as you talk to your hearts desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/a117ac42ba743d97f741328b95fd5db9.avif?t=1749231596\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop for new cosmetics at Gregson's Shop with the free in-game currency... Energy! Using energy, you can get all kinds of cosmetics of any type just with one click. This is how you can customize your character!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is lots to do in MasterRunners, so check it out <strong>TODAY!</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MasterRunners is a free-to-play multiplayer hand based movement game surrounding a variety of entertaining gamemodes, cosmetics, obstacles, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>10+ gamemodes</strong>, we guarantee this game is worth your time. We have lots to offer, so what are you waiting for!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can do:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Gamemodes with players across the <strong>WORLD</strong>. MasterRunners can be played worldwide and with our <strong>advanced multiplayer system</strong>, you can enjoy multiplayer &amp; have a very fun time. For the gamemodes, we build special gamemodes that have never been used in others games making us stand out and more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/e34766ac1beff9d2b9d8637372f07982.avif?t=1749231596\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill with friends and have a <strong>great time.</strong> With areas such as the &quot;Main Hub&quot;, you can relax and have a calming time with buddies as you talk to your hearts desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652080/extras/a117ac42ba743d97f741328b95fd5db9.avif?t=1749231596\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop for new cosmetics at Gregson's Shop with the free in-game currency... Energy! Using energy, you can get all kinds of cosmetics of any type just with one click. This is how you can customize your character!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is lots to do in MasterRunners, so check it out <strong>TODAY!</strong> </p>",
    "short_description": "MasterRunners is a free-to-play, hand-based movement VR multiplayer game packed with fun and variety. It offers a one-of-a-kind experience that stands out in the VR space. Whether you're into fast-paced action or just looking to hang out with friends, MasterRunners has something for everyone.",
